{"id":444,"title":"解答: 0-1列表排序","summary":"给出0-1列表排序的两种解法，其中解法2比较巧妙！","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"524ecdd2-dae1-4408-b042-13e9ea15c59f","text":"## 解法1: 暴力查找","text_html":"<h2>解法1: 暴力查找</h2>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"TabbedCode","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4a2ba8e6-2ef6-41e2-9e08-33077b08f222","caption":"","code_contents":[{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_0_4a2ba8e6-2ef6-41e2-9e08-33077b08f222","title":"sort_binary_list","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"def sort_binary_list(lst):\n    \"\"\"\n    A function to sort binary list\n    :param lst: A list containing binary numbers\n    :return: A sorted binary list\n    \"\"\"\n    \n    size = len(lst)  # Store the size of list\n\n    for i in range(size):\n        for j in range(0, size - i - 1):\n\n            # traverse the list from 0 to size - i - 1\n            # Swap if the element found is greater than the next element\n            if lst[j] > lst[j + 1]:\n                lst[j], lst[j + 1] = lst[j + 1], lst[j]\n                \n    return lst\n\n\n# Driver to test above code\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    \n    lst = [1, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0]\n    result = sort_binary_list(lst)\n    \n    print(result)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ce87a8f0-61c5-404c-a352-a891d736a805","text":"### 解释\n\n双层循环遍历每个数字对，计算最大乘积`max_product`，比记录相应的数字`max_i`和`max_j`。\n\n### 时间复杂度\n\n由于双层的循环，时间复杂度为$O(n^2)$。","text_html":"<h3>解释</h3>\n<p>双层循环遍历每个数字对，计算最大乘积<code>max_product</code>，比记录相应的数字<code>max_i</code>和<code>max_j</code>。</p>\n<h3>时间复杂度</h3>\n<p>由于双层的循环，时间复杂度为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141079999999999em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1.064108em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"3383f898-f716-4e0c-aaa8-3614b206649d","text":"## 解法2: 一次遍历","text_html":"<h2>解法2: 一次遍历</h2>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":3},{"type":"TabbedCode","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4e80b19e-bb39-4baa-bf2d-eb26d054c883","caption":"","code_contents":[{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_0_4e80b19e-bb39-4baa-bf2d-eb26d054c883","title":"sort_binary_list","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"def sort_binary_list(lst):\n    \"\"\"\n    A function to sort binary list\n    :param lst: A list containing binary numbers\n    :return: A sorted binary list\n    \"\"\"\n    \n    j = 0\n    \n    for i in range(len(lst)):\n        if lst[i] < 1:  # Swapping with jth element if the number is less than 1\n            lst[i], lst[j] = lst[j], lst[i]  # Swapping\n            j = j + 1\n    \n    return lst\n\n\n# Driver to test above code\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    \n    lst = [1, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0]\n    result = sort_binary_list(lst)\n    \n    print (result)\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":4},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"39ca1f75-93f4-4112-bd37-80ef693bec9c","text":"### 解释\n\n解法2更加聪明。因为求两个数乘积的最大值，而乘积最大值只会在：\n- 最小值 $\\times$ 第二小值\n- 最大值 $\\times$ 第二大值\n\n所以一次遍历，求出相关值（最大值、第二大值、最小值、第二小值）即可。\n\n### 时间复杂度\n\n一次循环遍历了列表，时间复杂读是$O(n)$。","text_html":"<h3>解释</h3>\n<p>解法2更加聪明。因为求两个数乘积的最大值，而乘积最大值只会在：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>最小值 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.58333em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.66666em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span> 第二小值</li>\n<li>最大值 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.58333em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.66666em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span> 第二大值</li>\n</ul>\n<p>所以一次遍历，求出相关值（最大值、第二大值、最小值、第二小值）即可。</p>\n<h3>时间复杂度</h3>\n<p>一次循环遍历了列表，时间复杂读是<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":5}],"status":"undo","course_no":"010","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/010/page/444"}
